<view class="home-page">
  <storybook-header title="把日子，煮成喜欢。" subtitle="星厨房 · 今天也要好好吃饭" scene="menu" bind:hometap="goOrder" />
  <view class="home-body">
    <text class="home-note">一起点菜，一起做饭，记住每一顿小幸福。</text>
    <button class="home-primary" bindtap="goOrder"><view class="primary-art"><kitchen-art kind="categories" /></view><view><text>今天想吃什么？</text><text class="primary-detail">去菜单选一道喜欢的</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button>
    <view class="home-grid">
      <button class="home-item" bindtap="goChef"><view class="item-art"><kitchen-art kind="add" /></view><text>我是大厨</text><text class="item-detail">让小厨房热闹起来</text></button>
      <button class="home-item" bindtap="goWishlist"><view class="item-art"><kitchen-art kind="wishes" /></view><text>我们的愿望</text><text class="item-detail">每一份都值得回应</text></button>
    </view>
    <button class="home-record" bindtap="goOrders"><image src="/images/cartoon/record.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>翻翻我们的吃饭手账</text><text>›</text></button>
    <text class="home-footer">♡ 今天的喜欢，就是明天回味的美味。</text>
  </view>
</view>
